{"quest_id": 6233, "name": "不殺の決意", "description": "対戦相手を殺さずに優勝を目指すと\n決意の王子達。迫る森の魔物達を退けよ！\n＜魔界審判がいる間敵の攻防80%減少＞\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "modifier_notes": ["魔界審判がいる間敵の攻防80%減少"], "event": "王者達のバトルロイヤル", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920095, "map_no": 5202, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 50, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 1250, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 1250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 4000, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 118, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2111376, "special_effect_id": 185, "master_id": 30567, "global_id": 4186, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 20000, "attack": 4500, "base_hp": 20000, "base_attack": 4500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_speed": 115, "attack_wait": 100, "attack_interval": 401, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.600000023841858, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2109424, "race_id": 13, "master_id": 30570, "global_id": 4189, "spawn_sec": 5}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4000, "attack": 320, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 320, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 40, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 30, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 151, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2101328, "race_id": 13, "missile_id": 90, "missile": {"speed": 8.0}, "master_id": 322, "global_id": 321, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 12}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 13, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 450, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 40, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 30, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 111, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103472, "race_id": 13, "missile_id": 125, "missile": {"speed": 8.0}, "master_id": 448, "global_id": 447, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 31}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 13, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 1100, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 1100, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 161, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103568, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 30568, "global_id": 4187, "spawn_sec": 45}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ケイティ", "text": "他の参加者を殺すのが優勝への近道……。\n先ほどの戦いは切り抜けましたが、\n他のチームも我々を狙ってくるかもしれませんね。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "他種族からすれば、\n人間はひ弱な獲物に過ぎないのかもしれません。\nですけど、私たちは――", "face": "l41ef8471a996"}, {"name": "アナトリア", "text": "――不殺で行く、って言うのかい？\n戦場で手加減するなんて、随分な余裕じゃないか。", "face": "u522"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あ、アナトリアさん！？\nまさか、もう出会ってしまうなんて……。\n次は、あなたが相手なのでしょうか？", "face": "l41ef8471a996"}, {"name": "アナトリア", "text": "……いや、戦うにはまだ早いね。\nそれより、不殺なんて本気で考えているのかい？\n自分たちの身を危険にするだけだってのに。", "face": "u522"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "ここが本当に戦場であるなら、\n命のやり取りも仕方ないとは思います。\nですが……。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ですが、王子はこの地に殺し合いではなく、\n魔界の武道大会に参加しに来たのです。\nたとえ、魔界では殺し合いが普通だとしても……。", "face": "l41ef8471a996"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "私たちは、私たちの信念で戦い抜いてみせます。\nこれまでそうだったように、この戦いも。\nそれが王子の、私たちの戦いなんです。", "face": "l41ef8471a996"}, {"name": "アナトリア", "text": "……ふぅん、そうかい。ま、あんたらのやり方に\nとやかく言う筋合いはあたしにはないか。\nあんたが勝ち残る事、期待してるよ、王子。", "face": "u522"}, {"name": "アナトリア", "text": "それじゃあたしは行くとするかね……あぁそれと、\n戦うにはまだ早いって理由だけど――", "face": "u522"}, {"name": "魔物", "text": "――グルルルルッ！", "face": "l81479f17a5a9"}, {"name": "アナトリア", "text": "横槍が入るのは、好きじゃないのさ。\nあんたたちなら心配いらないだろうけど、\n油断はするんじゃないよ。それじゃあね。", "face": "u522"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、魔界の森の魔物達です！\n戦闘のご準備をお願いします！", "face": "l41ef8471a996"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ケイティ", "text": "話に聞いていた通り、\n狂暴な魔物ばかりでしたね……。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ですが、魔物を倒した分のメダルが手に入りました。\nアナトリアさんの期待に応え、決着を付けるためにも、\n勝ち抜いていきましょう、王子！"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920095_5202", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 9, "y": 147}, {"k": "b", "x": 14, "y": 407}, {"k": "m", "x": 119, "y": 407, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 115, "y": 147, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 202, "y": 150, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 289, "y": 170, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 382, "y": 203, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 465, "y": 210, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 555, "y": 205, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 657, "y": 199, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 705, "y": 122, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 800, "y": 165, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 809, "y": 322, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 244, "y": 320, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 215, "y": 403, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 305, "y": 404, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 479, "y": 399, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 516, "y": 303, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 585, "y": 396, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 656, "y": 461, "id": 217}, {"k": "m", "x": 393, "y": 400, "id": 218}, {"k": "m", "x": 310, "y": 265, "id": 219}, {"k": "m", "x": 337, "y": 471, "id": 220}, {"k": "m", "x": 737, "y": 258, "id": 221}, {"k": "r", "x": 404, "y": 312, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 436, "y": 124, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 624, "y": 289, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 677, "y": 344, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 527, "y": 127, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 145, "y": 225, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 215, "y": 246, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 147, "y": 294, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 498, "y": 473, "id": 308}]}, "active": true, "story_talk": true}